---
// Hero.astro
---

<section id="hero" class="relative pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-40 md:pb-28 overflow-hidden bg-radial from-slate-50 via-brand-bg to-brand-bg">
  <!-- Subtle top grid decoration -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#8080800a_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#8080800a_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:14px_24px] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_50%_at_50%_0%,#000_70%,transparent_100%)] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- Subtle ambient glow -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-12 w-[800px] h-[350px] bg-brand-accent/5 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-start text-left max-w-5xl">
      <!-- Tag / Badge -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent-light border border-brand-border-dark text-brand-accent text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-6 animate-fade-in">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>Consultoría Estratégica & Analytics</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Headline / Claim -->
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-dark leading-[1.1] mb-6">
        Tecnología financiera, inteligencia de datos y estrategia para empresas que necesitan <span class="text-brand-accent">decidir mejor</span>.
      </h1>

      <!-- Subtitle -->
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-slate font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-10">
        Diseñamos sistemas de información, automatización y control financiero para convertir datos dispersos en decisiones ejecutivas claras, medibles y accionables.
      </p>

      <!-- Action Buttons -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto">
        <a href="#contacto" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold rounded-lg text-white bg-brand-accent hover:bg-brand-accent-hover active:scale-98 transition-all duration-200 shadow-sm">
          Solicitar diagnóstico
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2 -mr-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#soluciones" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold rounded-lg text-brand-dark bg-white border border-brand-border-dark hover:bg-slate-50 active:scale-98 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs">
          Ver soluciones
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Capability badges under CTAs -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-brand-border w-full">
        <div>
          <span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-brand-dark">E2E</span>
          <span class="block text-xs text-brand-muted mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Integración de datos</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-brand-dark">BI</span>
          <span class="block text-xs text-brand-muted mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Reportes accionables</span>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-2 md:col-span-1">
          <span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-brand-dark">AUTO</span>
          <span class="block text-xs text-brand-muted mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Procesos trazables</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(10px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  .animate-fade-in {
    animation: fadeIn 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
  }
</style>
